<title>UNITED NATIONS: Kenyan envoy takes over as U.N. council president.</title>
<headline>Kenyan envoy takes over as U.N. council president.</headline>
<dateline>UNITED NATIONS 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kenyan U.N. ambassador Njuguna Mahugu takes over the presidency of the Security Council on Saturday from ambassador Hisashi Owada of Japan.</p>
<p>The post rotates monthly according to the English alphabetical order of the council's 15 member delegations.</p>
<p>Kenya began a two-year term on the council on Jan. 1.</p>
</text>
